v class=\"message\"><br /> Which process is this? I am unfamiliar with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sun's Bounty from the Demon Translation Guide Pg. 41","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T20:12:59-08:00","id":834213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrytofloraGardener</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/832092-if-demons-won-the-war?p=834161#post834161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sun's Bounty from the Demon Translation Guide Pg. 41</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably why, I don't have that. How does it work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T21:35:48-08:00","id":834252,"title":"","content":"If Suns Bounty is fully activated apply the Immobilized Tilt Gain 1 Aether Per Turn Of Sunlight Or Strong Light,Or 1 Aether Per Minute Of Most interior lighting it can be partially manifested for 1 Aether to avoid being immobilized which gains 1 aether per minute of sunlight or per hour of most interior lighting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T05:46:52-08:00","id":834387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/832092-if-demons-won-the-war?p=834109#post834109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have pondered this scenario a couple times, and I have normally come to the conclusion that in order to keep the world as they know it and the various masquerades intact, they have to essentially either revive ( since I assume the physical Infrastructure is still present, merely inactive/lobotomized without the meta-intelligence of the G-M to run it) or replace the God-Machine. If not... well natural disasters, apocalypses, alien invasions and the destruction of the Masquerade probably happen. I personally, however, like the idea that it is in actuality a very clever long con by the Machine, in which it essentially &quot;shuts down&quot; and lets the demons think they've won- before springing some terrible trap months or years later. Either way, nothing ever is the same again for the Unchained, for better or ( much, MUCH) worse.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, the Machine is efficient. And It knows Its former servants are resourceful. One way to spin it is for It to &quot;play dead&quot;, let the Unchained created their God-Machine 2.0 replacement, then restore Itself and steal the &quot;backup&quot; they went to all the trouble of building. If a catastrophic apocalypse happens before then? Well, it can always revive then, avert it, and round up any Unchained caught out in the open. Less ideal, but still potential for gains.<br /> <br /> Another take is, if you are a fan of &quot;the God-Machine is from the future!&quot; theory, that the replacement the Unchained create <i>is the God-Machine</i>, and this is It ensuring the time loop is complete. Hence why it preserved humanity (and the status quo), and never fully made efforts to round up the Unchained - it needed them to create itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 02-21-2016, 08:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T12:34:54-08:00","id":834573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/832092-if-demons-won-the-war?p=834387#post834387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another take is, if you are a fan of &quot;the God-Machine is from the future!&quot; theory, that the replacement the Unchained create <i>is the God-Machine</i>, and this is It ensuring the time loop is complete. Hence why it preserved humanity (and the status quo), and never fully made efforts to round up the Unchained - it needed them to create itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cue Arnold Schwarzenegger saying &quot;Judgement Day is inevitable&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-22T01:30:20-08:00","id":834886,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/832092-if-demons-won-the-war?p=834573#post834573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Cue Arnold Schwarzenegger saying &quot;Judgement Day is inevitable&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>But if they send the Machine into the past, somehow, then wouldn't there be none in the future?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-22T06:09:04-08:00","id":834978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/832092-if-demons-won-the-war?p=834387#post834387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Well, the Machine is efficient. And It knows Its former servants are resourceful. One way to spin it is for It to &quot;play dead&quot;, let the Unchained created their God-Machine 2.0 replacement, then restore Itself and steal the &quot;backup&quot; they went to all the trouble of building. If a catastrophic apocalypse happens before then? Well, it can always revive then, avert it, and round up any Unchained caught out in the open. Less ideal, but still potential for gains.<br /> <br /> Another take is, if you are a fan of &quot;the God-Machine is from the future!&quot; theory, that the replacement the Unchained create <i>is the God-Machine</i>, and this is It ensuring the time loop is complete. Hence why it preserved humanity (and the status quo), and never fully made efforts to round up the Unchained - it needed them to create itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not actually a fan of that explanation of it merely being g a super powerful machine from the future really. I always found it to be a half ass attempt by Matt for an &quot;origin&quot; for the god-machine that stole far too much from terminator to be charming in any way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 02-22-2016, 09:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-22T07:19:41-08:00","id":835027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inquisitor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/832092-if-demons-won-the-war?p=834886#post834886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But if they send the Machine into the past, somehow, then wouldn't there be none in the future?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, the God-Machine they build gets sent back in the past, while the &quot;inactive&quot; God-Machine that already existed is still around. Of course, like all time-loop paradoxes, this still leaves unanswered the question of what started the whole cycle to begin with.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.co